<title>FINLAND: Kesko Jan-Aug profit falls 2.6 percent.</title>
<headline>Kesko Jan-Aug profit falls 2.6 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p>Profit before extraordinary items, tax 463 vs 475  Earnings per share (markka)	     3.17 vs 3.95</p>
<p> Net sales				   21,991 vs 17,604</p>
<p> Operating profit			     386 vs 327</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast profit after financial items, before extraordinaries and tax was 460 million markka in a 390-514 million markka range.  </p>
<p> Depreciation				  316 vs 228</p>
<p> Net financial items		   gain 77 vs 148 gain</p>
<p> Extraordinary gain			  189 vs 45</p>
<p> Extraordinary expenses		     11 vs 2</p>
<p> Net profit				    464 vs 399</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)     38.5 vs 56.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish wholesaler is Kesko Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245</p>
